 "caveats": [
  "ACI class 122 'Pasture / Forages' lumps alfalfa, clover, tame grass hay and pasture: it cannot say whether the field was alfalfa or grass hay in a given year (California's CDL separates them).",
  "[2009, 2010]: the ACI does not cover this part of BC in these years (value 0, not mapped).",
  "[2011, 2012, 2013, 2021]: AAFC mapped this area only as 120 'Agriculture (undifferentiated)' in these years (no crop type).",
  "ACI overall accuracy for crop classes in British Columbia, from the ACI specification: 88.34% (2024 map) and 89.02% (2025 map); 73-93% in earlier years. That is for all crop classes province-wide, not for forage at this field: treat single-year changes as possible errors.",
  "The outline was chosen from ACI forage pixels, so forage purity here is not an independent check."
 ]
}
